OL,3,GNEWSACathedral aisle shut after ceiling
OL,4,Astone falls
OL,5,
OL,6,FPart of a cathedral will remain
OL,7,Fcordoned off for weeks after a piece of
OL,8,Fmasonry fell from its ceiling.
OL,10,FThe south aisle of Bristol Cathedral,
OL,11,Fwhich is located in the city-centre,
OL,12,Fhas been closed to the public for
OL,13,Fsafety reasons since 22 September after
OL,14,Fpieces of stone were found on the
OL,15,Ffloor.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,343,340,200,160,0,100
