OL,3,GNEWSACathedral aisle shut after ceiling
OL,4,Astone falls
OL,5,
OL,6,FUsing a cherry picker to reach the high
OL,7,Fceiling and archways, a spokesperson
OL,8,Ffrom the cathedral said they expect the
OL,9,Farea to be closed "for a few weeks" as
OL,10,Fassessments to the damaged ceiling are
OL,11,Fcarried out. The rest of the cathedral
OL,12,Fremains open.
OL,14,F"We can confirm no individuals were in
OL,15,Fthe immediate vicinity when the masonry
OL,16,Ffell and no injuries were sustained,"
OL,17,Fsaid the spokesperson.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
